<section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h1>Travel is better when stories are real.</h1><p>Satya Journeys is being built around personal travel experiences, original photographs and videos, and journeys shared by friends and family.</p></section>
<section class="prose">
<h2>Our promise</h2>
<p>We distinguish first-hand experiences from contributed stories and research-based information. We aim to credit the source, explain when a trip took place, and flag information that may have changed.</p>
<h2>Built from real journeys</h2>
<p>Each story should preserve the experience behind the photograph. Each itinerary should help a traveller understand the route, timing, costs and choices involved.</p>
<p>This is an evolving project. Details on the website should be checked before travel, and service providers are identified according to what we know about their use and verification.</p>
</section>
